<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Money Performance Review privacy | RIPL Wealth</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body><main class="wrap" style="padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px;max-width:850px"><a href="/">← Back to the Money Performance Review</a><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:35px">RIPL WEALTH</p><h1>About your information</h1><p>You can take the quiz and see a result without giving us your name or email. Your quiz answers stay in this page until you choose to submit the contact form. Reloading or closing the page clears those answers.</p><h2>When you contact Adam</h2><p>The form asks for your name, email, optional phone number, and question. With your consent, it also sends your completed quiz answers, suggested stage, tendency, page address, and campaign tracking labels to Adam at RIPL Wealth. FormSubmit processes the submission and email delivery. Please do not enter account numbers, passwords, Social Security numbers, or private financial documents.</p><p>Sending the form requests a response to your inquiry. It does not sign you up for a newsletter or text messages. A successful form submission is not a booked appointment.</p><h2>Scheduling a conversation</h2><p>Calendly handles scheduling. It loads when you choose to view available times or open the calendar. After you send call context, the calendar link can prefill your name and email and carry campaign tracking labels. Your quiz answers are sent separately to Adam, not automatically attached to a confirmed Calendly appointment.</p><h2>Watching videos</h2><p>Recorded videos are hosted on YouTube. Opening a recorded video loads a YouTube privacy-enhanced embed, which connects to YouTube. Playback is subject to YouTube’s privacy practices. You can also open the video directly on YouTube.</p><h2>Campaign tracking</h2><p>This page captures UTM labels such as the ad source and campaign. These labels stay in browser session storage for the current tab session and travel with your inquiry and calendar link. The page does not add an advertising pixel. Calendly and FormSubmit operate under their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Questions or requests</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com">adam@riplwealth.com</a> with questions about your information, access, correction, or record retention. See also <a href="https://riplwealth.com/privacy/">RIPL’s general website privacy information</a>.</p></main></body></html>
